    "title": "Top Troops: Adventure RPG",
    "description": "Top Troops is a fantasy RPG game with a unique mix between strategy and merge mechanics. Easy to try, hard to master.\r\n\r\nThe war is raging and King's Bay has been wiped out by the King's evil brother!\r\n\r\nBuild your army, merge your troops, rank them up, and lead them into epic battles on all kinds of game modes: Adventure, PvP Arena, the Chambers of Destiny, Ancient Battles with your Clan,... Your order, your command!\r\n\r\nCustomize your troops using units of different roles and factions to defeat the Dark Army. Each position on the field can have a big impact on whether you win or you lose, so bring all of your best units but also your brain to the battle!\r\n\r\nLead the craziest army ever, including Wizards, Samurais, Dragons, and even a Vampire Queen! These and other unique troops are waiting for their new Commander.\r\n\r\nClassic features:\r\n- QUICK, FUN & EPIC BATTLES: Deploy the right combination of units onto the battlefield and see them use their unique skills in idle battles!\r\n- FORGE ALLIANCES IN CLANS and cooperate to defeat the Ancients!\r\n- COMPETE against the best players in the PvP Arena and rise to the top of the Leaderboard in Diamond League\r\n- MERGE & RANK UP your troops to knock down stronger enemies\r\n- EXPAND & MANAGE YOUR KINGDOM. Reconquer the land that was lost to the King's evil brother\r\n- CHOOSE YOUR STRATEGY: Combine units of different Factions and battle roles to maximize your chances of success!\r\n- RECRUIT THE BEST OF THE BEST. There are +50 Squads, each with their own unique skill set! \r\n- GAME MODES GALORE: Discover the Magic Island, earn rewards in the Adventure, face other players in the Arena, complete Quests, and learn the secrets of the Chambers of Destiny\r\n- KEEP COMING BACK for new units and time-limited events\r\n\r\nCommander, are you ready to face the challenge and lead the King's Top Troops to victory? Help the factions of King's Bay to earn back the land they lost!\r\n\r\nTop Troops is is FREE to download and includes optional in-game purchases (including random items). Information about drop rates for random item purchases can be found in-game. If you wish to disable in-game purchases, please turn off the in-app purchases in your phone or tablet's Settings.\r\n\r\nEnjoying Top Troops? Drop us a review. :)",
